sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Host client
    participant S as Crossfire server
    participant Alg as MatchmakingAlgorithm
    participant P as Peer client

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over H,Alg: v1.0 - FIND (matchmaking queue)
    H->>S: FIND {sessionKey, configuration}
    S->>Alg: initialize(request)
    Alg->>Alg: find-or-create MultiMatch,<br/>add profile
    Alg-->>S: setResult(match)
    S-->>H: MATCHED {matchId, profileId}
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over H,Alg: v1.0 - JOIN (reconnect by match ID)
    H->>S: JOIN {sessionKey, matchId}
    S->>Alg: resume(request)
    Alg->>Alg: verify profile is a member
    Alg-->>S: setResult(match)
    S-->>H: MATCHED {matchId, profileId}
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over H,Alg: v1.1 - CREATE (host makes a joinable match)
    H->>S: CREATE {sessionKey, configuration}
    S->>Alg: initialize(request)
    Alg->>Alg: create MultiMatch,<br/>generate join code
    Alg-->>S: setResult(match)
    S-->>H: CREATED {matchId, joinCode, profileId}
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over P,Alg: v1.1 - JOIN_CODE (peer joins by code)
    P->>S: JOIN_CODE {sessionKey, joinCode}
    S->>Alg: resume(request)
    Alg->>Alg: look up match by code,<br/>add profile if new
    Alg-->>S: setResult(match)
    S-->>P: MATCHED {matchId, profileId}
    end

    Note over H,P: Both connections are now in SIGNALING
